    "extract": "Chrysalis Records is a British independent record label that was founded in 1968. The name is both a reference to the pupal stage of a butterfly and a combination of its founders' names, Chris Wright and Terry Ellis. It started as the Ellis-Wright Agency.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Chrysalis Records</b> is a British independent record label that was founded in 1968. The name is both a reference to the pupal stage of a butterfly and a combination of its founders' names, <span><b>Chris</b> Wright</span> and <span>Terry <b>Ellis</b></span>. It started as the <b>Ellis-Wright Agency</b>.</p>"
